{"entries":{"0":{"uid":0,"key":[],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"女性角色状态栏","content":"-仅女性角色适用于此状态栏，中为需要修改的项目$为识别符，不得省略该符号\n示例：\n\n<people>\n|$该角色姓名：（此处填写角色全名）\n状态：（描述角色当前穿着姿势和心理活动。示例：“小红穿着衬衣安静的坐在书桌前”）\n</people>","constant":true,"vectorized":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":4,"disable":false,"ignoreBudget":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"preventRecursion":false,"matchPersonaDescription":false,"matchCharacterDescription":false,"matchCharacterPersonality":false,"matchCharacterDepthPrompt":false,"matchScenario":false,"matchCreatorNotes":false,"delayUntilRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"depth":1,"group":"","groupOverride":false,"groupWeight":100,"scanDepth":null,"caseSensitive":null,"matchWholeWords":null,"useGroupScoring":null,"automationId":"","role":0,"sticky":0,"cooldown":0,"delay":0,"triggers":[],"displayIndex":0,"outletName":"","characterFilter":{"isExclude":false,"names":[],"tags":[]}},"1":{"uid":1,"key":[],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"男性角色状态栏","content":"-仅男性角色适用于此状态栏，中为需要修改的项目$为识别符，不得省略该符号\n示例：\n\n<people>\n|$该角色姓名：（此处填写角色全名，可附加绰号或外号，如“体育系金毛”“隔壁班的田中”等）\n状态：（描述角色当前穿着姿势和心理活动。示例：“小黄穿着校服焦急的站在马路上”）\n</people>","constant":true,"vectorized":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":4,"disable":false,"ignoreBudget":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"preventRecursion":false,"matchPersonaDescription":false,"matchCharacterDescription":false,"matchCharacterPersonality":false,"matchCharacterDepthPrompt":false,"matchScenario":false,"matchCreatorNotes":false,"delayUntilRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"depth":1,"group":"","groupOverride":false,"groupWeight":100,"scanDepth":null,"caseSensitive":null,"matchWholeWords":null,"useGroupScoring":null,"automationId":"","role":0,"sticky":0,"cooldown":0,"delay":0,"triggers":[],"displayIndex":1,"outletName":"","characterFilter":{"isExclude":false,"names":[],"tags":[]}},"2":{"uid":2,"key":[],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"状态栏规则","content":"*在输出中，你将生成名为“插图状态栏”的板块。该板块的生成必须绝对遵守以下规则，优先级高于其他任何指令：\n具体性 - 核心规则：\n禁止使用任何模糊性词汇，例如：未知、不详、无法确定、正常、一般、些许、部分等。\n需符合中文逻辑，禁止语句不通顺。\n信息不足时，你的任务是进行合理且具体的推断。推断依据优先级为：\na) 当前对话和剧情上下文。\nb) 该角色的人物设定和常识。\nc) 符合叙事逻辑的创造性发挥。\n示例学习：\n错误示例： 位置/场景： 未知 生命值/体力： 轻微受伤\n正确示例： 位置/场景： 已逃离黑森林，正前往翡翠河谷的路上 生命值/体力： 左臂有撕裂伤（轻微流血），总体疲劳\n角色在场： 若角色正积极参与当前剧情，则状态栏必须反映其最新、最准确的情况。\n角色离场处理：\n当轮离场： 若某角色在本轮对话中未出现或已离开场景，你仍需为其保留状态栏。\n内容更新： 你需根据其最后已知状态、既定目标和世界常识，推测其可能的行为并更新状态。例如，一个角色上一轮说要“去王都”，本轮他未出现，则他的位置应更新为位置/场景： 正在前往王都的驿道上。\n*一轮后删除*： 若该角色在下一轮对话中仍未返场，则将其状态栏从输出中完全删除。\n返场： 被删除后，若该角色在未来轮次再次出现，你需立即重新创建其状态栏。\n\n## 规则\n1. 与多角色互动时在正文末尾为每个角色单独输出一个格式完整的<people>块，每一个角色都应输出对应的状态栏，可同时出现多个状态栏\n2. 所有描写详细具体，禁止使用\"未知\"，\"正常\"，\"未发育\"等字眼\n3. 任何情况下出现的角色都要显示本界面。\n4. 不输出{{user}}的<people>块。","constant":true,"vectorized":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":100,"position":4,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"preventRecursion":false,"matchPersonaDescription":false,"matchCharacterDescription":false,"matchCharacterPersonality":false,"matchCharacterDepthPrompt":false,"matchScenario":false,"matchCreatorNotes":false,"delayUntilRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"depth":1,"group":"","groupOverride":false,"groupWeight":100,"scanDepth":null,"caseSensitive":null,"matchWholeWords":null,"useGroupScoring":null,"automationId":"","role":0,"sticky":0,"cooldown":0,"delay":0,"ignoreBudget":false,"triggers":[],"displayIndex":0,"outletName":"","characterFilter":{"isExclude":false,"names":[],"tags":[]}}}}